    },
    {
      "text": "14种族与14职业组合，每职业再分配12项技能和30个天赋塑造角色",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Create a character from 14 races and 14 classes! Allocate attributes that favor your playing style! Level up 12 unique skills for each class! Which skills will you prioritize? Customize your hero by choosing from 30 unique talents.",
