      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Unique and set items have fixed property types, but their values vary! Hunt for the best possible version of your favorite set and unique items! Equip multiple set items to unlock powerful set bonuses! If you cannot find your favorite item, seek it out by trading items with other players!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/853450/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
